# SEO

- Housing: `/listings/[slug]`. Items: `/rent-items/[slug]`. Do not add `/property/[id]` aliases.
- Landings: `/rent/[city]/[area]`, `/rent-items/[category]/[city]`.
- `generateMetadata` per listing: title + description from details, OG image = primary photo.

```txt
3-Bedroom Apartment for Rent in Lekki, Lagos — ₦4,500,000/year | GoRent.ng
Generator for Rent in Ikeja, Lagos — ₦15,000/day | GoRent.ng
```

- Housing JSON-LD: `Apartment`/`Residence`. Items: `Product` + rental `Offer`.
- `app/sitemap.ts` must include all live listings and landings. Keep `app/robots.ts` in sync.
